Package: waterloggedshiny
Type: Package
Title: Waterlogged Shiny Application
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Matthew Bayly M.J. Bayly Analytics Ltd.
Maintainer: Matthew Bayly <mjbayly@mjbayly.com>
Description: Shiny application for processing water level and water quality
    data from HOBO data loggers. Provides a step-by-step workflow for
    binding logger files, converting raw measurements, QAQC, and data summaries.
